\section{Foundations of Physics with emphasis on Nuclear Physics}
The following subsections are the main topics relevant to the foundations of Physics, Nuclear Physics and current applications under development.
\begin{itemize} \item Outline of physics \item Particle physics \item Nuclear fusion \item Fusion power \item Quarks \item Gluons \item Parton \item ITER \item Quantum chromodynamics \item Quantum mechanics \item Quantum field theory \item Statistical mechanics \item Molecular dynamics \item Thermodynamics \item Experimental Physics \item Related Research fields: \item Atomic, molecular, and optical physics \item Unsolved problems in physics \item X-ray microscope \item 2D-FT NMRI and Spectroscopy \item Biophysics and Biophysical Chemistry \item Biophysics \item Current research \end{itemize}
\begin{thebibliography}{9} \bibitem{BCI2etal2k9} Contributed book. \PMlinkexternal{``Fundamentals of Physics with Emphasis on Nuclear physics.'', free 8 Mb PDF download}{http://planetphysics.org/?op=getobj&from=books&id=223}, 192pp, May 26th, 2009. \end{thebibliography}
